@startuml
title C4 Nivel 2 - Contenedores

actor Usuario
rectangle "App React/Capacitor" as Frontend
rectangle "API Express" as API
database "Supabase Auth/Postgres/Storage" as Supabase
cloud "OpenAI API" as OpenAI
rectangle "FastAPI rembg" as Rembg
cloud "Servicio de clima desde frontend" as Clima

Usuario --> Frontend : interactúa
Frontend --> API : HTTPS/JSON
API --> Supabase : datos, auth y storage
API --> OpenAI : prompts y visión
API --> Rembg : remove-bg
Frontend --> Clima : ubicación y pronóstico
@enduml
